---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="How Much Does Childcare Cost? | Marietta Childcare"
  description="Learn about Marietta Childcare's pricing, payment options, financial assistance programs, and tuition rates.">
  <section class="relative py-32 overflow-hidden w-screen -ml-[calc((100vw-100%)/2)]">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
      <img 
        src="/images/Background_Images/group_snack_time_healthy_eating_background.jpg" 
        alt="Childcare cost" 
        class="w-full h-full object-cover"
      />
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/40"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-6 lg:px-20">
      <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-6xl font-black mb-6 text-white drop-shadow-lg">How Much Does Childcare Cost?</h1>
      <p class="text-lg mb-12 max-w-2xl text-white drop-shadow-md">Pricing information, payment options, financial assistance programs, and tuition rates.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 px-6 lg:px-20">
    <div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto">
      <article class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">How Much Does Childcare Cost at Marietta Childcare?</h1>
        
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-8">Marietta Childcare understands that childcare costs represent a significant family investment. Marietta Childcare offers transparent pricing structures designed to accommodate diverse family budgets and financial circumstances.</p>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Tuition Pricing Overview</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's tuition rates vary based on the child's age group and program type. Infant care at Marietta Childcare typically represents the highest tuition tier due to the intensive staffing ratios required for infants. Toddler programs at Marietta Childcare offer mid-range pricing, while preschool programs at Marietta Childcare provide cost-effective options for older children.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare accepts children starting at 6 weeks old, with age-specific pricing for each developmental stage. The pricing structure at Marietta Childcare reflects the specialized care, trained educators, and curriculum resources provided at each age level.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Payment Options and Flexibility</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare provides multiple payment options to simplify family finances. Weekly tuition payments at Marietta Childcare allow families to manage cash flow more effectively than monthly billing. Monthly payment plans at Marietta Childcare offer convenience for families preferring consolidated billing.</p>
          <p>Part-time and drop-in care options at Marietta Childcare accommodate families with flexible scheduling needs. Families interested in part-time enrollment or drop-in care should speak with an enrollment advisor at Marietta Childcare to discuss available options at the Marietta location.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Financial Assistance Programs</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare recognizes that childcare affordability challenges affect many families in the Marietta, Georgia area. Marietta Childcare accepts childcare subsidy vouchers and tuition assistance programs to help eligible families access quality care.</p>
          <p>Families seeking financial assistance should contact an enrollment advisor at Marietta Childcare or speak with the center director. The enrollment team at Marietta Childcare can explain eligibility requirements and available assistance programs. Georgia's childcare subsidy program provides state-funded support for qualifying families, and Marietta Childcare participates in this program.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">What's Included in Tuition</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's tuition includes comprehensive services beyond basic supervision. Marietta Childcare provides a robust preschool curriculum designed to prepare children cognitively, socially, and emotionally for kindergarten. The curriculum at Marietta Childcare emphasizes global awareness and service learning.</p>
          <p>Meals and snacks are included in tuition at Marietta Childcare, with nutrition standards ensuring balanced, age-appropriate nutrition. Marietta Childcare accommodates food allergies and dietary restrictions. Educational materials, developmental programming, and access to specialized staff at Marietta Childcare are included in the tuition rate.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Summer Camp Tuition</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's summer camp programs operate on a weekly tuition model. Summer camp tuition at Marietta Childcare requires weekly payment to hold your child's spot in the class, even if your child does not attend every week.</p>
          <p>Summer camp registration at Marietta Childcare starts in March for currently enrolled students and April for the general public. Start and end dates for summer camp vary by location, so families should speak with the Marietta center director for specific dates.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">GA Pre-K Program Costs</h2>
          <p>Georgia Pre-K at Marietta Childcare is state lottery-funded, eliminating tuition costs for families whose children attend only during GA Pre-K hours. GA Pre-K at Marietta Childcare operates during the regular school year only, typically from 8:00 AM to 3:00 PM.</p>
          <p>Families choosing extended care beyond GA Pre-K hours at Marietta Childcare pay tuition only for the additional hours. Private Pre-K at Marietta Childcare requires tuition and registration fees, with rates varying by location and program type.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Illness and Attendance Policies</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's tuition policy addresses attendance during illness. Families do not pay tuition at Marietta Childcare if their child does not attend due to illness, provided proper notification is given to the center.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's sick child policy protects the health of all children and staff. Marietta Childcare requires that children with fever, contagious symptoms, or communicable illnesses remain home until they meet specific health criteria.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Enrollment and Registration Fees</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare may charge registration fees to secure your child's enrollment. Registration fees at Marietta Childcare vary by program type and age group. GA Pre-K at Marietta Childcare has no registration fee when children attend only during GA Pre-K hours.</p>
          <p>For specific information about current tuition rates and registration fees at Marietta Childcare, families should contact the enrollment team or center director. Marietta Childcare's enrollment advisors can provide detailed pricing information and discuss payment options tailored to your family's needs.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-blue-50 p-6 rounded-lg mb-12">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Ready to Learn More?</h3>
          <p class="mb-4">Marietta Childcare welcomes families to discuss pricing, financial assistance, and enrollment options. Contact Marietta Childcare today to schedule a tour and speak with an enrollment advisor about how Marietta Childcare can serve your family's childcare needs.</p>
          <a href="/contact" class="inline-block bg-blue-600 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-blue-700 transition">Schedule a Tour</a>
        </section>

        <nav class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-gray-200">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">Related Pages</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2">
            <li><a href="/faq/enrollment-process" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">What's the Enrollment Process?</a></li>
            <li><a href="/solutions/budget-conscious" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">Affordable Childcare Options</a></li>
            <li><a href="/faq/parent-communication" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">How Do You Communicate with Parents?</a></li>
            <li><a href="/programs" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">Our Programs</a></li>
            <li><a href="/contact" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">Contact Marietta Childcare</a></li>
          </ul>
        </nav>
      </article>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
